WEBVTT

00:27:28.610 --> 00:27:31.036
RB: Probably, at this moment
around the globe,

00:27:31.060 --> 00:27:33.626
there are millions of people
sitting in offices,

00:27:33.650 --> 00:27:35.926
just waiting, browsing Facebook,

00:27:35.950 --> 00:27:38.287
sending emails to people
they don't really like,

00:27:38.311 --> 00:27:41.256
writing reports
that no one's ever going to read.

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:43.416
I think we could
easily move to a four-day,

00:27:43.440 --> 00:27:44.726
three-day workweek,

00:27:44.750 --> 00:27:46.276
and be just as productive.

00:27:46.300 --> 00:27:50.047
You just squash out all the slack
that's currently in the system.

00:27:50.071 --> 00:27:52.246
AG: How many hours do you actually work?

00:27:52.270 --> 00:27:56.496
RB: I think about 50 to 60.

00:27:56.520 --> 00:28:00.576
If you would define
my work as, you know ...